A '''Senate apartment complex''' located in [[Coruscant]]'s [[Federal District|Senate District]]<ref name="Complete Locations" /> was the site of [[Padmé's Apartment]], a suite occupied by [[Senator]] [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] of [[Naboo]] during her tenure in the [[Galactic Senate]].<ref name="Databank" /> The grand apartment block<ref name="Complete VD">''[[Star Wars: The Complete Visual Dictionary, New Edition]]''</ref> was a high-security complex standing in an upscale region near the [[Imperial Senate Building|Galactic Senate Building]], one of many buildings occupied by diplomatic staff from the millions of [[star system]]s in the Senate. The complex had a parking bay on a balcony several floors below Padmé's suite, where Senator [[Simon Greyshade]] kept his [[XJ-6 airspeeder]].<ref name="Complete Locations" /> When [[Jedi Knight]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] broke one of the windows in Amidala's apartment to pursue those behind the [[plot to assassinate Senator Amidala]], droids [[Buffy]] and [[Mick]] were dispatched to repair and clean up the damage.<ref name="Episode II" />

